@startuml read-path
title US-01: Read Path - Dashboard Renders Live Map

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

actor Operator
participant "Angular\nDashboard" as Dashboard
participant "Express API" as API
database "Redis\nentity:live:{id}" as Redis

Operator -> Dashboard : opens live map

Dashboard -> API : establish WebSocket connection

note over API
  Express + ws library.
  One persistent connection per client.
  No polling required.
end note

loop on each position update received by API
  API -> Redis : HGETALL entity:live:*
  Redis --> API : { entity_id, lat, lon, altitude, timestamp_ms }
  API --> Dashboard : push position payload over WebSocket
  Dashboard --> Operator : entity position updated on map
end

note over Dashboard, Operator
  Entities with expired Redis TTL
  are absent from the response
  and removed from the map.
end note

@enduml
